{'symbol': 'REGN', 'date': '2022-10-28 08:00:00', 'title': 'INMAZEB™ (ATOLTIVIMAB, MAFTIVIMAB, AND ODESIVIMAB-EBGN) WINS PRESTIGIOUS 2022 PRIX GALIEN USA BEST BIOTECHNOLOGY PRODUCT AWARD', 'text': 'INMAZEB IS THE FIRST FDA-APPROVED TREATMENT FOR ZAIRE EBOLAVIRUS TARRYTOWN, N.Y. , OCT. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REGENERON PHARMACEUTICALS, INC. (NASDAQ: REGN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT INMAZEB™ (ATOLTIVIMAB, MAFTIVIMAB, AND ODESIVIMAB-EBGN) HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS THE "BEST BIOTECHNOLOGY PRODUCT" OF 2022 BY THE GALIEN FOUNDATION, WHICH ACKNOWLEDGES EXTRAORDINARY SCIENTIFIC INNOVATIONS THAT IMPROVE THE HUMAN CONDITION.'}